One defect of this retry, and its fix

The first tree run of this retry failed with
"page.evaluate: ReferenceError: elementName is not defined" in R-P6-F3c and in
R32. The cause: page.evaluate sends only the body of the function to the
browser, so a module level helper does not exist there. The fix moves the
element name helper inside measureLeafSidesInBrowser. The box text helper
stays at module level, because leafSidePlacementProblems runs in Node. The
second tree run gave the result above.

